<title>INDIA: India OTCEI begins trading in Unit Scheme-64 units.</title>
<headline>India OTCEI begins trading in Unit Scheme-64 units.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Over-the-Counter Exchange of India (OTCEI) said on Friday it began trading in the units of Unit Scheme-64.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
